  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // Settings 2: Neopets' own Settings (a Vue app: every section, switched without a new page) in the boards' look, in your theme.
  // Its fields stay its own and save as ever; beside them, a few helpers: themes as swatches, a live preview of your posts, a NeoTitle
  // finder, a NeoHTML builder, a signature counter, each pen's avatar
